Z||000000||Dan010||12-22-2001||11:10 PM||||What is the normal (average) down shift speed from second to first without full throttle???<BR>Seems I have to be 15mph or below to get it to downshift, unless I floor it. Is this normal??? From 3rd to second seems to be just fine.<BR>Going around corners is a bit annoying, when it dont down shift.<BR>Thanks for all your help.<P>This weekend,changed trans fluid, engine oil,<BR>pcv valve, gas filter and add a used front sway bar to the rear, changed original front sway bar bushings to poly. Waiting for rack bushing from Rodney. Still have a slight knock in rack when I rock the steering wheel back and forth, some up-down play still after replacing inner and outer tie-rods (both sides).||||reg||1
Z||000001||JetroGT||12-23-2001||07:50 AM||||Check the kick down cable. Look to see if it's damaged/melted. Or the tranny may have stickey valve bodies.||||reg||1
